# Wiki page edits (CCC)

Follow `CLAUDE.md` wiki page format on every create/update.

## Frontmatter (required)

- `type`: source | entity | concept | brief
- `maturity`: draft | validated | core
- `related:` — **bidirectional**: if A lists B, B must list A
- Bump `updated:` on meaningful body changes

## Body section order

`## Relations` → `## Raw Concept` → `## Narrative` → `## Snippets` → optional `## Dead Ends`

## Links

- Inline: `@path/to/page.md` (relative to `wiki/`, no leading slash)
- Cross-wiki: `@osint-wiki/...`, `@cybersecurity-wiki/...`, etc.
- Claims: `[CONFIRMED]`, `[TENTATIVE]`, `[NEEDS VERIFICATION YYYY-MM-DD]`, `[RETRACTED]`

## After edits

```bash
python3 scripts/wiki_lint.py
```

Fix orphans, dangling `related:`, and bidirectional gaps before considering the edit done.
